[[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238803\">7040A65</a>\n                                           (left and right)</p><p><a href=\"#/3238343\">5040D22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238986\">7065C42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238514\">5570T80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237934\">2125C24</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238802\">7040A60</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238117\">3380A44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238851\">7040L28</a></p><p>1. Unscrew the bolts</p><p>2. Remove the trim complete with support.</p><p>3. If necessary, undo the bolts and separate the trim from the support.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019316.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,127,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the trim is undamaged.</p><p>If detached, refit the trim on the support\nand tighten the bolts.</p><p>Place the trim and support in position.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238851\">7040L28</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238117\">3380A44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238802\">7040A60</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3237934\">2125C24</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238514\">5570T80</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238986\">7065C42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238343\">5040D22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238803\">7040A65</a>\n                                           (left\nand right)</p><p>Check component operation after refitting.</p>"],[2047,96,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3238803\">7040A65</a>\n                                           (left\nand right sides)</p><p><a href=\"#/3238852\">7040L37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238986\">7065C42</a></p><p>1. Unscrew the bolts</p><p>2. Loosen the side bolts.</p><p>3. Remove the tunnel cover.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2019317.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2047,96,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check that the tunnel trim is not damaged.</p><p>Place the tunnel cover in position and\nsecure it using the bolts.</p><p><a href=\"#/3238986\">7065C42</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238852\">7040L37</a></p><p><a href=\"#/3238803\">7040A65</a>\n                                           (left\nand right sides)</p>"]]